{"speciesId":538,"names":{"fr":"Judokrak","es":"Throh","en":"Throh","ja":"ナゲキ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand il noue sa ceinture, il devient plus puissant. Les Judokrak sauvages tressent leur ceinture avec des lianes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When it tightens its belt, it becomes stronger. Wild Throh use vines to weave their own belts."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ils aiment projeter ceux qui sont plus grands qu’eux. On les trouve toujours par groupes de cinq."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"When they encounter foes bigger than themselves, they try to throw them. They always travel in packs of five."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When it encounters a foe bigger than itself, it wants to throw it. It changes belts as it gets stronger."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When it encounters a foe bigger than itself, it wants to throw it. It changes belts as it gets stronger."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Quand il noue sa ceinture, il devient plus puissant. Les Judokrak sauvages tressent leur ceinture avec des lianes."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Aumenta su potencia si se aprieta el cinturón. Un Throh salvaje teje su propio cinturón usando lianas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When it tightens its belt, it becomes stronger. Wild Throh use vines to weave their own belts."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"帯を 締めると パワーアップする。 野生の ナゲキは つる草を 編んで 自分の 帯を 作る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ils aiment projeter ceux qui sont plus grands qu’eux. Ils changent de ceinture quand ils progressent."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Si se topa con un rival más fuerte, ansía lanzarlo por los aires. Al hacerse más fuerte, cambia su cinturón."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When it encounters a foe bigger than itself, it wants to throw it. It changes belts as it gets stronger."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"自分より 大きな 相手と 出会うと 無性に 投げたくなる。 強くなると 帯を 取り替える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Quand il noue sa ceinture, il devient plus puissant. Les Judokrak sauvages tressent leur ceinture avec des lianes."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Aumenta su potencia si se aprieta el cinturón. Un Throh salvaje teje su propio cinturón usando lianas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When it tightens its belt, it becomes stronger. Wild Throh use vines to weave their own belts."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"帯を 締めると パワーアップする。 野生の ナゲキは つる草を 編んで 自分の 帯を 作る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ils aiment projeter ceux qui sont plus grands qu’eux. Ils changent de ceinture quand ils progressent."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Si se topa con un rival más fuerte, ansía lanzarlo por los aires. Al hacerse más fuerte, cambia su cinturón."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When it encounters a foe bigger than itself, it wants to throw it. It changes belts as it gets stronger."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"自分より 大きな 相手と 出会うと 無性に 投げたくなる。 強くなると 帯を 取り替える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses techniques de projection sont sans égal. Quand il se bat, sa sueur coule sur sa ceinture et lui donne une teinte plus foncée."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su técnica de lanzamiento es formidable. El sudor que exhala durante el combate impregna su cinturón, cuyo color se vuelve más intenso."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It performs throwing moves with first-rate skill. Over the course of many battles, Throh’s belt grows darker as it absorbs its wearer’s sweat."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"投げ技の 腕は 一流。 戦いで かいた 汗が 染み 帯の 色が 濃く 染まっていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ils s’entraînent intensément par groupes de cinq. Ceux qui ne peuvent pas suivre le rythme abandonnent leur ceinture et se retirent."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Entrenan en grupos de cinco individuos. Si alguno es incapaz de seguir el ritmo, arroja el cinturón y abandona la cuadrilla."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"They train in groups of five. Any member that can’t keep up will discard its belt and leave the group."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"５匹の 群れで 稽古に はげむ。 稽古に ついていけない ものは 帯を 捨てて 群れを 去る。"}],"varieties":[{"id":538,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[11,"level-up",29],[14,"level-up",29],[15,"level-up",29],[16,"level-up",29],[17,"level-up",21],[18,"level-up",21],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"low-kick","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"seismic-toss","learns":[[11,"level-up",13],[14,"level-up",13],[15,"level-up",13],[16,"level-up",13],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",5],[20,"level-up",40]]},{"name":"strength","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"dig","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[11,"mach